  {
   "id": "sally-face-26580@1.5.44",
   "gameId": "sally-face-26580",
   "displayName": "Update 1.5.44",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-11T12:51:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new patch has been made available on the Experimental branch! The primary focus of this is to address recent reports of players not being able to access the DLC after having played the first Episode by itself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If anybody is having issues playing the DLC, please try this patch out to see if it resolves your issues. To do so, right click on the game in your Library, selecting Properties, then Betas, and then change your branch to Experimental. The game should then update and be ready to go.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, I want to thank everyone who has been providing feedback and reporting issues, you have all been a big help! Please continue reporting problems either through the Sally Face Discord, on the Steam discussions, or you can always email me directly at mike@portablemoose.com !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mike",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 1.5.44",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue where playing Episode 1 without the DLC would cause issues with the game later recognizing whether the DLC exists or not",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed \"sync\" button where The Unknown achievement would not sync properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added translation for recently added \"sync\" button in the achievements menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted game sliders (such as what is used for the audio) to no longer be framerate dependent making them easier and more consistent to use",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted version in the main menu to contain a bit more information to help us diagnose potential future problems",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
